<<
/Title (COSMIC POWER PRIVATE LIMITED represents a forward-looking premium FMCG company committed to delivering healthy, naturally sourced, and clean-label food products through its flagship brand, Golden Deer. The company focuses on providing premium roasted makhana, dry fruits, organic staples, wellness beverages, and other nutritious food products that promote healthier lifestyles while maintaining the highest standards of quality, food safety, and sustainability. Through its direct farm-to-pack sourcing model, modern processing infrastructure, premium packaging, and customer-centric approach, the company consistently delivers products that combine superior nutrition, authentic taste, and long-term consumer trust.)
/Dest [65 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1818 0 R
/Next 807 0 R
